ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256742927/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1550050253","hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/910630/209145/05ba49cd39ec492bb1f3b69d58bc387766878dfd/1750595383/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1550050253","mp4":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/256742927/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Indie"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Achievements","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":true},"controller":"full","dev":["Fiction Factory Games"],"pub":["PQube"],"released":"Feb 12, 2019","meta":78,"langs":["English"],"min":[["OS","Windows XP"],["Processor","1 GHz Intel or AMD Processor"],["Memory","1 GB RAM"],["Graphics","DirectX or OpenGL compatible card"],["DirectX","Version 9.0c"],["Storage","100 MB available space"]],"rec":[["OS","Windows Vista or above"],["Memory","1 GB RAM"]],"deck":2,"blurb":"Romance and arcade culture meet in this visual novel, which takes place in an alternate 20XX where the video game crash of 1983 never happened. After a rough run of jobs, your character starts work at the Funplex arcade, a busy place full of distinctive employees and customers.\n\nYou design your own protagonist, including pronouns, hairstyle, skin tone and eye color, and those choices carry through the art and the story. Roleplay-style decisions shape your personality and your relationships, whether they stay friendly, platonic or turn romantic. It is single-player with full controller support, and it suits readers who enjoy dialogue-heavy stories, retro arcade nostalgia and a lot of say in who their character becomes."}}